:: Work 1 {"position":"3975,550","size":"100,100"}
You decided to do some work around the Library.
Work hours:
6:00AM - 6:00PM
<<if $drinksrng>>
You served $drinksrng drinks, gaining $drinksrng col.

<</if>>\
You can:
<<if setup.datesystems.default.getDate().h gte 6 and setup.datesystems.default.getDate().h lte 17>>\
<<link [[Serve water to people reading (2.5 col per drink served, 1 hour)|Work 1]]>>
<<dateadd '1h'>>
<<set _drinksrng to random((3 + $DEX), (7 + $DEX))>>
<<set $drinkserved += _drinksrng>>
<<set $Coins += $drinksrng*2.5>>
<<set $curFatigue += 40 + $drinksrng>>
<<set $hoursWorked += 1>>
<</link>>
<<if $hoursWorked >= 50>>\
<<link [[Sweep the floor (23 col per 1 hour)|Work 1]]>>
<<dateadd '1h'>>
<<set $Coins += 23>>
<<set $curFatigue += 82>>
<<set $hoursWorked += 1>>
<</link>>
<<elseif $hoursWorked <= 49>>\
You need to work for 40 hours before being able to swipe the floor!<</if>>
<<if $hoursWorked >= 100>>\
<<link [[Put books back to their place (43 col per 1 hour)|Work 1]]>>
<<dateadd '1h'>>
<<set $Coins += 43>>
<<set $curFatigue += 102>>
<<set $hoursWorked += 1>>
<</link>>
<<elseif $hoursWorked <= 99>>\
You need to work for 100 hours before being able to place books back!<</if>>\
<<else>>[[Its too early for work.|Library 1]]
<</if>>\

<<link [[Go back|Library 1]]>>
    <<unset $drinksrng>>
<</link>>


